### Catalog geo
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/tracks

### Create track (JOOQ POJO — no mocks)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/tracks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Judge smoke track",
  "provider": "eh8s",
  "bandId": 1
}
